            {
                "author": "mark desilva",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Working with Raven at EDTECH EDU LLC was an absolute pleasure. She undertook the challenge of recreating our website for Champion Equipment Finance in a remarkably short period, transforming a potentially stressful situation into an enjoyable and fun experience. Raven's expertise in web design and development is top-notch.\n\nThroughout the entire process, she collaborated with us every step of the way, ensuring we were involved in all major decisions and updates. Her dedication to educating us on new technologies was invaluable, leaving us more informed and confident about our online presence.\n\nRaven’s professionalism, creativity, and commitment to excellence exceeded our expectations. We are extremely pleased and feel blessed to have had her cross our paths. Thank you again, Raven, and we can't wait to start our next project with you on our company LMS!",
                "date": "2024-06-24T14:25:32.872Z"
            },
            {
                "author": "Sarah Sewalelot",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "I’ve worked with Raven on a few different projects and she was nothing but the best! Her attention to detail and ability to interpret your through process is impressive.\nI’m a solo entrepreneur and am so blessed to have been referred  to this company.",
                "date": "2024-01-06T02:56:02.213Z"
            },
            {
                "author": "Chalice Savage",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Anything that Raven is involved with turns to gold because of her creative mind and open heart. I have utilized her services in the past and she was able capture me in a way I could not do for myself. She is a creative genius and I am trilled to continue my journey with her on my team.",
                "date": "2018-12-04T04:21:28.340Z"
